GIVEN Age    IS A NUMBER
      Scheme IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
PrefixComparisons Age Scheme MEANS
  BRANCH
    IF Age <  18 AND Scheme EQUALS "child" THEN JUST "minor"
    IF ^   >= ^  ^   ^      ^      ^       THEN JUST "adult"
    IF ^   <= 21 ^   ^      ^      "youth" THEN JUST "young"
    IF ^   >  ^  ^   ^      ^      ^       THEN JUST "adult"
    OTHERWISE NOTHING

